.TH CODESTEGO 1 "2026" "codestego 0.9.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
codestego \- keyed steganographic watermarking for source code
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B codestego
\fICOMMAND\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Embed a short, encrypted payload (owner, recipient, note, timestamp) into
comments and insignificant whitespace of C, C++, Go, Java, JavaScript,
TypeScript, Rust, HTML, XML, or SGML source. Extraction requires your secret key.
.PP
Commands include
.BR keygen ,
.BR embed ,
.BR extract ,
.BR scan ,
.BR capacity ,
.BR strip ,
and
.BR doctor .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/codestego/key
Default master key path (mode 0600).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B CODESTEGO_KEY
Hex-encoded 32-byte master key (alternative to a key file).
.SH SEE ALSO
Full documentation:
.IR /usr/share/doc/codestego/USER_GUIDE.md .
.PP
Project README and
.B codestego --help
for flag details.
